{"4200110":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Nekome: Nazi Hunter ","steam_appid":4200110,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4859720],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/f4d4de6083a56d0b3781358eedaaff32.poster.avif?t=1792439176\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/f4d4de6083a56d0b3781358eedaaff32.webm?t=1792439176\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/f4d4de6083a56d0b3781358eedaaff32.mp4?t=1792439176\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nekome: Nazi Hunter<\/i> is a single-player, third-person action game following Vano Nastasu, a young Romani man driven by grief and vengeance after Nazi soldiers brutally murder his family. Transform from hunted to hunter in an odyssey of revenge across a war-torn world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout enemy routes, plan your attacks, and strike with precision through stealth and close-quarters combat.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by grindhouse cinema, <i>Nekome<\/i> delivers visceral combat, grounded finishing moves, and encounters where every action carries consequences.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REVENGE IS PERSONAL<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission begins in the enemy’s backyard, where you’ll stalk Nazis, assassinate guards, and set traps to frighten your foes. Enemy awareness is shared and persistent—kill carelessly and patrols respond, wait too long and reinforcements arrive. Stealth isn’t about avoiding the fight. It’s about stacking the odds before the true combat begins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/c7a79f0b39feb20269d522b650ab121b.poster.avif?t=1792439176\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/c7a79f0b39feb20269d522b650ab121b.webm?t=1792439176\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/c7a79f0b39feb20269d522b650ab121b.mp4?t=1792439176\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STRATEGIC COMBAT<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter is your chance to craft a savage masterpiece. Melee is raw, brutal, and bloody, built for life-or-death, close quarters fighting with each punch, stab, and parry making an impact. Use improvised weapons to gain the advantage over enemies who adapt to your fighting style, slow down combat to chain targeted strikes into cinematic assaults, and bring the violence to a finale with visceral finishing blows.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/3c1214b9fbea07905a7545153fa1836d.poster.avif?t=1792439176\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/3c1214b9fbea07905a7545153fa1836d.webm?t=1792439176\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/3c1214b9fbea07905a7545153fa1836d.mp4?t=1792439176\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTORIETY AND FEAR<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notoriety and fear systems add another layer to combat, allowing you to make an example of your enemies and watch their morale collapse. Fear becomes a formidable weapon earned through surgical, savage tactics. Kill with precision or create chaos, and enemies may panic, hesitate, or flee. The notoriety system tracks your brutality and unpredictability, influencing the enemies’ next actions. Some Nazis may rush in blindly, while others refuse to enter the room.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/3e9fde259988e8835e1049ac2de3f290.poster.avif?t=1792439176\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/3e9fde259988e8835e1049ac2de3f290.webm?t=1792439176\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/3e9fde259988e8835e1049ac2de3f290.mp4?t=1792439176\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORLD IS YOUR WEAPON<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with fists, blades, guns, and whatever the environment provides. Nazi-occupied spaces are filled with pipes, tools, and hazards waiting to be used as improvised weapons. Choose your path, set your traps, and weaponize the world against your enemies.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/f4d4de6083a56d0b3781358eedaaff32.poster.avif?t=1792439176\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/f4d4de6083a56d0b3781358eedaaff32.webm?t=1792439176\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/f4d4de6083a56d0b3781358eedaaff32.mp4?t=1792439176\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nekome: Nazi Hunter<\/i> is a single-player, third-person action game following Vano Nastasu, a young Romani man driven by grief and vengeance after Nazi soldiers brutally murder his family. Transform from hunted to hunter in an odyssey of revenge across a war-torn world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout enemy routes, plan your attacks, and strike with precision through stealth and close-quarters combat.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by grindhouse cinema, <i>Nekome<\/i> delivers visceral combat, grounded finishing moves, and encounters where every action carries consequences.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REVENGE IS PERSONAL<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission begins in the enemy’s backyard, where you’ll stalk Nazis, assassinate guards, and set traps to frighten your foes. Enemy awareness is shared and persistent—kill carelessly and patrols respond, wait too long and reinforcements arrive. Stealth isn’t about avoiding the fight. It’s about stacking the odds before the true combat begins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/c7a79f0b39feb20269d522b650ab121b.poster.avif?t=1792439176\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/c7a79f0b39feb20269d522b650ab121b.webm?t=1792439176\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/c7a79f0b39feb20269d522b650ab121b.mp4?t=1792439176\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STRATEGIC COMBAT<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter is your chance to craft a savage masterpiece. Melee is raw, brutal, and bloody, built for life-or-death, close quarters fighting with each punch, stab, and parry making an impact. Use improvised weapons to gain the advantage over enemies who adapt to your fighting style, slow down combat to chain targeted strikes into cinematic assaults, and bring the violence to a finale with visceral finishing blows.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/3c1214b9fbea07905a7545153fa1836d.poster.avif?t=1792439176\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/3c1214b9fbea07905a7545153fa1836d.webm?t=1792439176\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/3c1214b9fbea07905a7545153fa1836d.mp4?t=1792439176\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTORIETY AND FEAR<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notoriety and fear systems add another layer to combat, allowing you to make an example of your enemies and watch their morale collapse. Fear becomes a formidable weapon earned through surgical, savage tactics. Kill with precision or create chaos, and enemies may panic, hesitate, or flee. The notoriety system tracks your brutality and unpredictability, influencing the enemies’ next actions. Some Nazis may rush in blindly, while others refuse to enter the room.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/3e9fde259988e8835e1049ac2de3f290.poster.avif?t=1792439176\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/3e9fde259988e8835e1049ac2de3f290.webm?t=1792439176\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/extras\/3e9fde259988e8835e1049ac2de3f290.mp4?t=1792439176\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORLD IS YOUR WEAPON<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with fists, blades, guns, and whatever the environment provides. Nazi-occupied spaces are filled with pipes, tools, and hazards waiting to be used as improvised weapons. Choose your path, set your traps, and weaponize the world against your enemies.<\/p>","short_description":"Hunt and kill Nazis in a stealthy single-player campaign with bloody and brutal melee combat. Study your enemies, confirm your approach, and become an unexpected assassin fueled by violent revenge.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/d69c6a193a2b073da410355d8304cb53d3e4a199\/header.jpg?t=1792439176","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/d113055fc8d7020f9839d94cf514e0c85e532c14\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792439176","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4200110\/d113055fc8d7020f9839d94cf514e0c85e532c14\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792439176","website":"http:\/\/www.nekome-game.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-9500\/Ryzen 5 3500x<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GTX 1660ti\/Radeon RX 5500XT<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 15 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Surround Sound<br><\/li><li><strong>VR Support:<\/strong> No<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and Operating System<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i7-11700k\/Ryzen 7 5700x3d<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 32 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia RTX 3070\/Radeon RX 7700XT<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 15 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Surround Sound<br><\/li><li><strong>VR Support:<\/strong> No<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and Operating System<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"legal_notice":"PROBABLYMONSTERS, the PROBABLYMONSTERS logo, NEKOME, NEKOME: NAZI HUNTER, and the NEKOME NAZI HUNTER logo are trademarks of ProbablyMonsters Inc. ©2026 ProbablyMonsters Inc. All Rights Reserved."}}}